# Violet Ankh key (items.md Keys), world pickup. Same shape as the HUD icon
# assets/src/hud/key_violet.pix, scaled to 16x24: loop head in fb_violet (the key's
# fullbright colour, shaded on its far side by the ramp), violet ramp crossbar
# and stem lit from the top-left. Frame 1 of the 18-tic shimmer: an
# fb_white glint on the head moves from top-left (f0) down the left side (f1).
name key_violet_idle_d0_f1
size 16 24
= 1 violet_02
= 2 violet_04
= 3 violet_06
= 4 violet_08
= 5 violet_10
= 6 violet_11
= F fb_violet
= W fb_white
outline fb_violet violet_00
outline fb_white violet_00
grid
